  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-missing-picnic-cup-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "898dac3ed0a38682e031e6d43c20b019640cc89a340fbfdaf9d9c43a6e7e525b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "389a03a6ebe417f33b3a132f5ae3ddb1c04c2f0f03ba234167550f1b99e7780d",
      "text": "悟空少算了谁？",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "25ab01f2fa61a3ddf451ea49557999491d020ca5809d297b61b39c99b72c8296",
      "text": "今天去野餐啦！\n悟空提着一篮杯子。\n“摆杯子的事，交给我！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a196251b731ba61a4efcf304876ff397e4f6b86df867999865de7548105b7cf",
      "text": "好朋友们爬上小山坡：\n八戒、玉兔、敖丙，还有铁扇公\n主！\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "18eedac5b9e7f3cde05cfd9a6194d4e73f5f17d07495b6db33697a781fc6833d",
      "text": "悟空数一数朋友：\n“一、二、三、四。”\n“四个朋友！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2d8735a1f08c631abd6a4ee4a9898d7d1f9064907bc07b9f4b917ed1239c9a1",
      "text": "他从篮子里拿出杯子。\n“八戒，一个杯子给你。”\n“玉兔，一个杯子给你。”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8f2279a72c6f577919f62e7a6f6251df3fbd92081157613b1c53483fe358cc0a",
      "text": "“敖丙，一个杯子给你。”\n“铁扇公主，一个杯子给你。”\n“四个朋友，四个杯子。摆好啦！”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d549fe875bdcad0520c507da6835e3ed36a9eb62c57ef015f742d8f740b0772c",
      "text": "铁扇公主倒上桃子汁。\n悟空也坐下来，\n可他两手空空。\n“咦？我的杯子呢？”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "40c020e2b19d2136c883bcb5e5a2a0bb94b0a4a8fd46101cdaa78e09676b480f",
      "text": "悟空掀起垫子角看看。\n“不在这儿！”\n八戒跑到树后找找。\n“这儿也没有！”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3e8ce8f02ee383951062ea9d0793b0564b73b1a5235d8397ff80ad43370475a2",
      "text": "铁扇公主扇了扇铁扇。\n呼——树叶全飞起来了！\n“哎呀，扇得太猛啦！”\n树上也没有杯子。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bc5df9a5ab15578a5b94ac64a7f437e71f44186f724df36c638eb849b53e178a",
      "text": "敖丙问：“一共几个杯子？”\n“我们数数看：一、二、三、四。”\n“最后数到四，\n就是一共有四个杯子。”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d1bed10026a106d010e8eef40355f030e3c483d2a851a3eb702be36784a07e70",
      "text": "玉兔问：“那朋友有几个？”\n悟空一个一个地指：\n“一、二、三、四。”\n大家一起指向了悟空！\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fc031f8a863287a80fc9723763728f922593ead07ffc1bf7b8022b726462ea7a",
      "text": "“哦！还有我！”\n悟空拍拍自己的胸口。\n“我也是朋友呀。五个！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fdd55a6f10aac0c4e4b2086eeb0ada3c70e43c9012add05a6aa886f207dd08e6",
      "text": "他从篮子里又拿出一个杯子。\n“一个杯子给我！”\n“一、二、三、四、五。\n五个朋友，五个杯子。”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ba4864baa0936c55cedc7a575df21196095e74a558b3106881fa3e4c5ce960b8",
      "text": "八戒拍拍圆肚子：\n“我的肚子也要一个座位！”\n玉兔笑弯了腰：\n“肚子可不用杯子呀！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e270653a25c8ae4da888c3b8156c056d33e9feeab4c2258c5ff332da19de23f3",
      "text": "五个杯子举起来，\n叮、叮、叮、叮、叮！\n五个朋友一起喝桃子汁。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8ea40071fb2b75b8d201a4596dbd0f75b0f3dab291066052dfcf3c3204c3b22b",
      "text": "野餐结束了，悟空把杯子收进篮\n子。\n“一、二、三、四、五。”\n“下次呀，我先数我自己！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
