    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cd1f02a56d8a531beae88df29c1508da61b7d68da470e255b4deb61e70114f5d",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n数一数朋友，\n也别忘了数自己！\n每人都有一个杯子。\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
